# R3f: Z1 12-key keypad from vendor kernel reverse engineering.
# Mainline driver registers as "mt6779-keypad".
# Key codes are the original factory values (250-254 = F1-F6 etc).
# User mapping: 复读(repeat) = VOLUME_UP effect, 跟读(follow) = VOLUME_DOWN effect.
# Physical F-keys 250/251 are the repeat/follow candidates; both mapped so
# either physical key produces the requested volume event (verify on device
# which is which, then narrow down).
key 114   VOLUME_DOWN       WAKE_DROPPED
key 251   VOLUME_DOWN       WAKE_DROPPED
key 250   VOLUME_UP         WAKE_DROPPED
key 115   VOLUME_UP         WAKE_DROPPED
key 252   VOLUME_UP         WAKE_DROPPED
key 106   DPAD_RIGHT
key 232   DPAD_CENTER       WAKE
key 105   DPAD_LEFT
key 103   DPAD_UP
key 158   BACK
key 108   DPAD_DOWN
key 254   VOLUME_DOWN       WAKE_DROPPED
